{"title":"国家发改委明确，除勘察、设计、监理外，涉及工程的其他中介服务不属于法定招标范围","date":"2020-12-18","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#CB313F;letter-spacing:\r\n.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">国家发展改革委办公厅关于进一步做好《必须招标的工程项目规定》和《必须招标的基础设施和公用事业项目范围规定》</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#CB313F;letter-spacing:\r\n.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">实施工作的通知</span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.75pt;\">发改办法规〔<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;2020</span>〕<span lang=\"EN-US\">770</span>号</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-indent: 31pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.75pt;\">各省、自治区、直辖市、新疆生产建设兵团发展改革委、公共资源交易平台整合牵头部门：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-indent: 31pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.75pt;\">为加强政策指导，进一步做好《必须招标的工程项目规定》（国家发展改革委<span lang=\"EN-US\">2018</span>年第<span lang=\"EN-US\">16</span>号令，以下简称<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;16</span>号令<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>）和《必须招标的基础设施和公用事业项目范围规定》（发改法规规〔<span lang=\"EN-US\">2018</span>〕<span lang=\"EN-US\">843</span>号，以下简称<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;843</span>号文<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>）实施工作，现就有关事项通知如下：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:\r\n14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; line-height: 150%; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nHelvetica;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">一<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span>、<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span>准确理解依法必须招标的工程建设项目范围</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-indent: 31.1pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:black;letter-spacing:\r\n.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">（一）关于使用国有资金的项目。<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.75pt;\">16</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.75pt;\">号令第二条第（一）项中<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>预算资金<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>，是指《预算法》规定的预算资金，包括一般公共预算资金、政府性基金预算资金、国有资本经营预算资金、社会保险基金预算资金。第（二）项中<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>占控股或者主导地位<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>，参照《公司法》第二百一十六条关于控股股东和实际控制人的理解执行，即<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>其出资额占有限责任公司资本总额百分之五十以上或者其持有的股份占股份有限公司股本总额百分之五十以上的股东；出资额或者持有股份的比例虽然不足百分之五十，但依其出资额或者持有的股份所享有的表决权已足以对股东会、股东大会的决议产生重大影响的股东<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>；国有企业事业单位通过投资关系、协议或者其他安排，能够实际支配项目建设的，也属于占控股或者主导地位。项目中国有资金的比例，应当按照项目资金来源中所有国有资金之和计算。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; line-height: 150%; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-indent: 31.1pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:black;letter-spacing:\r\n.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">（二）关于项目与单项采购的关系。<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.75pt;\">16</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.75pt;\">号令第二条至第四条及<span lang=\"EN-US\">843</span>号文第二条规定范围的项目，其<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nHelvetica;color:black;letter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">勘察、设计、施工、监理以及与工程建设有关的重要设备、材料等的单项采购分别达到<span lang=\"EN-US\">16</span>号令第五条规定的相应单项合同价估算标准的，该单项采购必须招标<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.75pt;\">；该项目中未达到前述相应标准的单项采购，不属于<span lang=\"EN-US\">16</span>号令规定的必须招标范畴。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; line-height: 150%; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-indent: 31.1pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:black;letter-spacing:\r\n.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">（三）关于招标范围列举事项。<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.75pt;\">依法必须招标的工程建设项目范围和规模标准，应当严格执行《招标投标法》第三条和<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;16</span>号令、<span lang=\"EN-US\">843</span>号文规定；法律、行政法规或者国务院对必须进行招标的其他项目范围有规定的，依照其规定。没有法律、行政法规或者国务院规定依据的，<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background:yellow\">对<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;16</span>号令第五条第一款第（三）项中没有明确列举规定的服务事项、<span lang=\"EN-US\">843</span>号文第二条中没有明确列举规定的项目，不得强制要求招标。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; line-height: 150%; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-indent: 31.1pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:black;letter-spacing:\r\n.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">（四）关于同一项目中的合并采购。<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.75pt;\">16</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.75pt;\">号令第五条规定的<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>同一项目中可以合并进行的勘察、设计、施工、监理以及与工程建设有关的重要设备、材料等的采购，合同估算价合计达到前款规定标准的，必须招标<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>，目的是防止发包方通过化整为零方式规避招标。其中<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>同一项目中可以合并进行<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>，是指根据项目实际，以及行业标准或行业惯例，符合科学性、经济性、可操作性要求，同一项目中适宜放在一起进行采购的同类采购项目。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; line-height: 150%; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-indent: 31.1pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:black;letter-spacing:\r\n.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">（五）关于总承包招标的规模标准。<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.75pt;\">对于<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;16</span>号令第二条至第四条规定范围内的项目，发包人依法对工程以及与工程建设有关的货物、服务全部或者部分实行总承包发包的，总承包中施工、货物、服务等各部分的估算价中，只要有一项达到<span lang=\"EN-US\">16</span>号令第五条规定相应标准，<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nHelvetica;color:#D92142;letter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">即施工部分估算价达到<span lang=\"EN-US\">400</span>万元以上，或者货物部分达到<span lang=\"EN-US\">200</span>万元以上，或者服务部分达到<span lang=\"EN-US\">100</span>万元以上，则整个总承包发包应当招标。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; line-height: 150%; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nHelvetica;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">二<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span>、<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span>规范规模标准以下工程建设项目的采购</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-indent: 31pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.75pt;\">16</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.75pt;\">号令第二条至第四条及<span lang=\"EN-US\">843</span>号文第二条规定范围的项目，其施工、货物、服务采购的单项合同估算价未达到<span lang=\"EN-US\">16</span>号令第五条规定规模标准的，<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:red;letter-spacing:.75pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt\">该单项采购由采购人依法自主选择采购方式，任何单位和个人不得违法干涉；<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.75pt;\">其中，<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:red;letter-spacing:1.5pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt\">涉及政府采购的，按照政府采购法律法规规定执行</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:red;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">。</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.75pt;\">国有企业可以结合实际，建立健全规模标准以下工程建设项目采购制度，推进采购活动公开透明。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; line-height: 150%; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nHelvetica;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">三<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span>、<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span>严格执行依法必须招标制度</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-indent: 31pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:red;letter-spacing:.75pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt\">各地方应当严格执行<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;16</span>号令和<span lang=\"EN-US\">843</span>号文规定的范围和规模标准，<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:red;letter-spacing:1.5pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">不得另行制定必须进行招标的范围和规模标准</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nHelvetica;color:red;letter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">，也不得作出与<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;16</span>号令、<span lang=\"EN-US\">843</span>号文和本通知相抵触的规定</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.75pt;\">，</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.75pt;\">持续深化招标投标领域<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>放管服<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>改革，努力营造良好市场环境。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; line-height: 150%; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<br />\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:#3D464D;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br />\r\n\t<!--[endif]--></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\nline-height:150%;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"right\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6pt; text-align: right; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.75pt;\">国家发展改革委办公厅</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; line-height: 150%; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; line-height: 150%; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; line-height: 150%; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<u><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;color:red\">参考条文：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; line-height: 150%; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;color:red\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.4pt;\">必须招标的工程项目规定</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.4pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.4pt;\">中华人民共和国国家发展和改革委员会令<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span>第<span lang=\"EN-US\">16</span>号</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-indent: 29.7pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.4pt;\">第五条</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.4pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.4pt;\">本规定第二条至第四条规定范围内的项目，其勘察、设计、施工、监理以及与工程建设有关的重要设备、材料等的采购达到下列标准之一的，必须招标：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-indent: 29.6pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#D92142;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">（一）施工单项合同估算价在<span lang=\"EN-US\">400</span>万元人民币以上；</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-indent: 29.6pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#D92142;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">（二）重要设备、材料等货物的采购，单项合同估算价在<span lang=\"EN-US\">200</span>万元人民币以上；</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-indent: 29.6pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#D92142;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">（三）勘察、设计、监理等服务的采购，单项合同估算价在<span lang=\"EN-US\">100</span>万元人民币以上。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-indent: 29.6pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<u><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.4pt;\">同一项目中可以合并进行</span></u><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">的勘察、设计、施工、监理以及与工程建设有关的重要设备、材料等的采购，合同估算价合计达到前款规定标准的，必须招标。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; line-height: 150%; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.4pt;\">国家发展改革委关于印发《必须招标的基础设施和公用事业项目范围定》的通知<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">发改法规规〔<span lang=\"EN-US\">2018</span>〕<span lang=\"EN-US\">843</span>号</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-indent: 29.7pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt\">第二条</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">不属于《必须招标的工程项目规定》第二条、第三条规定情形的大型基础设施、公用事业等关系社会公共利益、公众安全的项目，必须招标的具体范围包括：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-indent: 29.6pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt\">（一）煤炭、石油、天然气、电力、新能源等能源基础设施项目；<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-indent: 29.6pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt\">（二）铁路、公路、管道、水运，以及公共航空和<span lang=\"EN-US\"> A1 </span>级通用机场等交通运输基础设施项目；<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-indent: 29.6pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt\">（三）电信枢纽、通信信息网络等通信基础设施项目；<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-indent: 29.6pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt\">（四）防洪、灌溉、排涝、引（供）水等水利基础设施项目；<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-indent: 29.6pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt\">（五）城市轨道交通等城建项目。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>"}